(2515521, 345828, 52925, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry, but I don''t see how you could think this would be a succesful picture. It is not clear what you are photographing, what it is you want to show and how this relates to the challenge. I''m not even talking about the technical aspects of this shot (out of focus, blurry and muted colors), as I assume this is what you were going for.</td>', 'I''m sorry, but I don''t see how you could think this would be a succesful picture. It is not clear what you are photographing, what it is you want to show and how this relates to the challenge. I''m not even talking about the technical aspects of this shot (out of focus, blurry and muted colors), as I assume this is what you were going for.', '2006-06-14 07:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
