(2516496, 345944, 50715, '<td valign="top">Can a person be an "unneccessary luxury"? I''m not convinced this meets the challenge. But setting that aside... you have an attractive model and the sepia toning is nice, but the lighting is too contrasty and has washed out all the detail in her skin, along with the blown out highlights in her hair. Softening and reducing the strength of the overhead lighting would help control the contrast, remove the obvious shadows from onder her chin, and bring back some detail and texture into her face without sending her hair into complete shadow.</td>', 'Can a person be an "unneccessary luxury"? I''m not convinced this meets the challenge. But setting that aside... you have an attractive model and the sepia toning is nice, but the lighting is too contrasty and has washed out all the detail in her skin, along with the blown out highlights in her hair. Softening and reducing the strength of the overhead lighting would help control the contrast, remove the obvious shadows from onder her chin, and bring back some detail and texture into her face without sending her hair into complete shadow.', '2006-06-14 12:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2516534, 347543, 50231, '<td valign="top">Nice Set up! Great Idea!</td>', 'Nice Set up! Great Idea!', '2006-06-14 12:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
