(2516556, 345828, 50715, '<td valign="top">I''m having trouble working out what it is... my best guess is something dangling down from the back of a woman''s waist - something to grab? I''ll be intrigued to find out what it is afterwards.<br/> <br/>Anyway, it''s an interesting abstract image! However it looks like you''ve done a little too much adjustment of the levels or curves, because I can see obvious colour banding in several parts, particular the light pinkish patch in the bottom-centre of the frame (that I interpreted as a woman''s inside thigh).</td>', 'I''m having trouble working out what it is... my best guess is something dangling down from the back of a woman''s waist - something to grab? I''ll be intrigued to find out what it is afterwards. Anyway, it''s an interesting abstract image! However it looks like you''ve done a little too much adjustment of the levels or curves, because I can see obvious colour banding in several parts, particular the light pinkish patch in the bottom-centre of the frame (that I interpreted as a woman''s inside thigh).', '2006-06-14 12:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
