(2518766, 346149, 55837, '<td valign="top">I can''t see what this is a picture of.</td>', 'I can''t see what this is a picture of.', '2006-06-15 00:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518768, 345943, 25678, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture of action, but a few things detract.  First, the background is loud in colour and really detracts from the main subject.  The picture seems a but flat as well.  A bit of tweaking in levels/curves would bump the colours and contrast as well.  There is no sense of height with this picture.  If you had been able to maybe squat a little lower to give a more ''from below'' angle would have added to the shot I think<br/> <br/>This meets the challenge (IMHO) since riding bikes is an indulgence for some!</td>', 'This is a great capture of action, but a few things detract.  First, the background is loud in colour and really detracts from the main subject.  The picture seems a but flat as well.  A bit of tweaking in levels/curves would bump the colours and contrast as well.  There is no sense of height with this picture.  If you had been able to maybe squat a little lower to give a more ''from below'' angle would have added to the shot I think This meets the challenge (IMHO) since riding bikes is an indulgence for some!', '2006-06-15 00:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
