(2518808, 346237, 25678, '<td valign="top">Oh yum.  I love Eggs benedict!  <br/> <br/>The cream, sugar and honey pots are nice little touches.  <br/> <br/>The reflections behind the sugar pot are a bit distracting.  maybe try hanging a plain sheet so the reflection is all one colour?  I know how hard it can be to deal with reflections in basic ediitng.  <br/> <br/>It looks like a flash was  used in this.  Maybe try using a tripod, longer exposure, and no flash.  You probably won''t get those white reflections on the eggs this way</td>', 'Oh yum.  I love Eggs benedict!   The cream, sugar and honey pots are nice little touches.   The reflections behind the sugar pot are a bit distracting.  maybe try hanging a plain sheet so the reflection is all one colour?  I know how hard it can be to deal with reflections in basic ediitng.   It looks like a flash was  used in this.  Maybe try using a tripod, longer exposure, and no flash.  You probably won''t get those white reflections on the eggs this way', '2006-06-15 00:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518809, 345238, 55837, '<td valign="top">Hot lights in your studio?  I don''t like the dripping or the background.</td>', 'Hot lights in your studio?  I don''t like the dripping or the background.', '2006-06-15 00:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
