(2518816, 346835, 25678, '<td valign="top">Oh the joys of watermelon!  I think this picture has a lot of potential.  It feels a touch snapshot-ish to me.  I think if you had crouched a bit lower, to be more on the level of the kids or the watermelon would make this picture more intimate.  Also, some slight tweaking in levels/curves and a tiny bump in saturation would help make the colours ''pop'' a bit more</td>', 'Oh the joys of watermelon!  I think this picture has a lot of potential.  It feels a touch snapshot-ish to me.  I think if you had crouched a bit lower, to be more on the level of the kids or the watermelon would make this picture more intimate.  Also, some slight tweaking in levels/curves and a tiny bump in saturation would help make the colours ''pop'' a bit more', '2006-06-15 00:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2518818, 345377, 55837, '<td valign="top">Same effect as in Shadows III.</td>', 'Same effect as in Shadows III.', '2006-06-15 00:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
