(2521106, 347604, 57658, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - I can see that you are trying to show how good the indulgence feels but the lighting is distracting. it brings attention to the hair and not the indulgence. Also the right side could do with more cropping since it adds nothing</td>', 'Nice idea - I can see that you are trying to show how good the indulgence feels but the lighting is distracting. it brings attention to the hair and not the indulgence. Also the right side could do with more cropping since it adds nothing', '2006-06-15 20:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
