(2521409, 345773, 43031, '<td valign="top">Little bit overboard on the title, use a deft touch, not a club over the head. Needs a bit more depth of field, and a change in composition. I would have to be there to tell you exaclty what. Probably a few feet higher, slightly to the left, and camera rotated about 30 degrees clockwise with the curve of the first hood in a left thirds position in the frame is my first impression. either that, or do a full frontal of that first beautiful chrome bumper making things symmetrical.</td>', 'Little bit overboard on the title, use a deft touch, not a club over the head. Needs a bit more depth of field, and a change in composition. I would have to be there to tell you exaclty what. Probably a few feet higher, slightly to the left, and camera rotated about 30 degrees clockwise with the curve of the first hood in a left thirds position in the frame is my first impression. either that, or do a full frontal of that first beautiful chrome bumper making things symmetrical.', '2006-06-15 22:03:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2521421, 347330, 43031, '<td valign="top">one word: foam. if you want to convey indulgence, you want a picture thats enticing, inviting, salivating if you''re talking food. my lovely coffe is on the floor, caffiene addicts suddenly feel very depressed looking at this. nice placement, little too dark: white highlights are actually grey here, while the shadows have lost detail.</td>', 'one word: foam. if you want to convey indulgence, you want a picture thats enticing, inviting, salivating if you''re talking food. my lovely coffe is on the floor, caffiene addicts suddenly feel very depressed looking at this. nice placement, little too dark: white highlights are actually grey here, while the shadows have lost detail.', '2006-06-15 22:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
