(2522968, 347478, 3087, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot, one of the stronger ones in this challenge (which seems to be full of snapshots or snapshot-alikes). This one stands alone aesthetically and also meets the challenge really well too. Nice shot, hope you score in the top 10 at least. Edit to add: this is my second favourite shot this challenge!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot, one of the stronger ones in this challenge (which seems to be full of snapshots or snapshot-alikes). This one stands alone aesthetically and also meets the challenge really well too. Nice shot, hope you score in the top 10 at least. Edit to add: this is my second favourite shot this challenge!', '2006-06-16 17:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
