(2522981, 347543, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is a nice idea and I like the effort put in but the finished product isn''t quite there for me - the backdrop is too sharply in focus which means I can see every crease and wrinkle. The model looks uncomfortably hunched up on a teeny tiny stool or is she sitting on the floor. And most of all her expression just looks slightly embarassed/ annoyed rather than conveying the joy of all her indulgent pleasures.</td>', 'This is a nice idea and I like the effort put in but the finished product isn''t quite there for me - the backdrop is too sharply in focus which means I can see every crease and wrinkle. The model looks uncomfortably hunched up on a teeny tiny stool or is she sitting on the floor. And most of all her expression just looks slightly embarassed/ annoyed rather than conveying the joy of all her indulgent pleasures.', '2006-06-16 17:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
