(2523985, 346990, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is a great angle of view that makes this thing look larger than life. I like everything about it except the overdone processing in the sky. It''s just the pink about the front windshield that I find distracting. Otherwise, amazing. The detail you''ve got in the shadows, around the tires, is amazing.</td>', 'This is a great angle of view that makes this thing look larger than life. I like everything about it except the overdone processing in the sky. It''s just the pink about the front windshield that I find distracting. Otherwise, amazing. The detail you''ve got in the shadows, around the tires, is amazing.', '2006-06-17 10:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2523987, 347173, 31133, '<td valign="top">This is such an adorable little girl - what a face! This would be a winner if the background were not so distracting. Also, I think some punch added with post-processing would add a great deal to this. This kid is just so cute. Thanks for the smile.</td>', 'This is such an adorable little girl - what a face! This would be a winner if the background were not so distracting. Also, I think some punch added with post-processing would add a great deal to this. This kid is just so cute. Thanks for the smile.', '2006-06-17 10:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2523990, 346835, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! This is one of my absolute favorites in the challenge. The way you''ve captured these sweet little girls'' expressions make it feel like there is nothing in the world more important than watermelon :-) Looks like they are right, too!</td>', 'Beautiful! This is one of my absolute favorites in the challenge. The way you''ve captured these sweet little girls'' expressions make it feel like there is nothing in the world more important than watermelon :-) Looks like they are right, too!', '2006-06-17 10:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2523994, 347478, 10848, '<td valign="top">Man talk about over-indulgence :). This is great. Very good lighting and the set up is perfect. 10</td>', 'Man talk about over-indulgence :). This is great. Very good lighting and the set up is perfect. 10', '2006-06-17 10:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2523995, 346247, 31133, '<td valign="top">I just increased your score by one point because that is one of the best titles ever ;-)</td>', 'I just increased your score by one point because that is one of the best titles ever ;-)', '2006-06-17 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2523997, 347486, 10848, '<td valign="top">Love this! Thanks for the laugh...10</td>', 'Love this! Thanks for the laugh...10', '2006-06-17 10:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
