(2524001, 346172, 31133, '<td valign="top">I think this is a little oversharpened. The white edges on the text and the Porsche text is slightly distracting. Otherwise, nice job. Beautiful car.</td>', 'I think this is a little oversharpened. The white edges on the text and the Porsche text is slightly distracting. Otherwise, nice job. Beautiful car.', '2006-06-17 10:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
