(2526565, 347521, 52765, '<td valign="top">suppose to be indulgence not extravagance</td>', 'suppose to be indulgence not extravagance', '2006-06-18 17:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526795, 346247, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice moment captured.  Something''s wrong with the direction of lighting, but I can''t put my finger on it enough to make a suggestion.  Maybe some USM or saturation would help give it some extra impact.  I''d like to see a slightly wider crop too, rather than the tight portrait crop.  Great indulgence!</td>', 'Nice moment captured.  Something''s wrong with the direction of lighting, but I can''t put my finger on it enough to make a suggestion.  Maybe some USM or saturation would help give it some extra impact.  I''d like to see a slightly wider crop too, rather than the tight portrait crop.  Great indulgence!', '2006-06-18 20:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526796, 347503, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not photograpically appealing, but I appreciate the years of effort you all put into preparation of physique.  :)</td>', 'Not photograpically appealing, but I appreciate the years of effort you all put into preparation of physique.  :)', '2006-06-18 20:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526801, 345408, 39430, '<td valign="top">You''ll probably get lots of comments on the focus, and I agree with them.  Possibly camera shake has ruined the clarity.  Would be nice to have got a better reflection on a less noisy floor.  Not bad though.  I like the crop.</td>', 'You''ll probably get lots of comments on the focus, and I agree with them.  Possibly camera shake has ruined the clarity.  Would be nice to have got a better reflection on a less noisy floor.  Not bad though.  I like the crop.', '2006-06-18 20:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526805, 347407, 39430, '<td valign="top">The model is very incidental in this shot, like you too a shot with a model, and then didn''t like it, and tried to crop them out, but couldn''t quite get rid of them.  Just a bit odd.  The mirror makes it very hard to focus on the main subject of the shot.</td>', 'The model is very incidental in this shot, like you too a shot with a model, and then didn''t like it, and tried to crop them out, but couldn''t quite get rid of them.  Just a bit odd.  The mirror makes it very hard to focus on the main subject of the shot.', '2006-06-18 21:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526808, 346756, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  I like the blurred crowd from the heat.  I''d like to see this shot at a higher f number, giving some of the crowd in focus, and increasing the impact of the heat haze.  Good job though.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  I like the blurred crowd from the heat.  I''d like to see this shot at a higher f number, giving some of the crowd in focus, and increasing the impact of the heat haze.  Good job though.', '2006-06-18 21:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526813, 347493, 39430, '<td valign="top">My biggest gripe about my camera is the white balance problems.  Shooting outdoors in shadow, I always have to override the white balance, and it looks like you need to do the same thing to bring out some warmer colours.  I''m not big on the colour of the wall either - it doesn''t work, particulary with the not quite the same colour shirt.  It also kind of looks like he is getting squished between the table and the wall.  All this aside, it''s a good subject and good crop.</td>', 'My biggest gripe about my camera is the white balance problems.  Shooting outdoors in shadow, I always have to override the white balance, and it looks like you need to do the same thing to bring out some warmer colours.  I''m not big on the colour of the wall either - it doesn''t work, particulary with the not quite the same colour shirt.  It also kind of looks like he is getting squished between the table and the wall.  All this aside, it''s a good subject and good crop.', '2006-06-18 21:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526815, 347475, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the reflected clouds, and the close shot helps to emphasise that.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the reflected clouds, and the close shot helps to emphasise that.', '2006-06-18 21:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526818, 345720, 39430, '<td valign="top">Oooh, my pet hate is white balance problems.  If the shot doesn''t look right, try some different white balance options, and use manual if you have to.  Tasty subject though, although I don''t like the look of the fried-egg flavour in the background.  :)  Oh, you could try some sharpening to give the image more impact.</td>', 'Oooh, my pet hate is white balance problems.  If the shot doesn''t look right, try some different white balance options, and use manual if you have to.  Tasty subject though, although I don''t like the look of the fried-egg flavour in the background.  :)  Oh, you could try some sharpening to give the image more impact.', '2006-06-18 21:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526831, 347265, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the feeling of being on the water with the fisherman.  Slight overexposure overall.  Needs some editing to give the image more contrast.  The sky is a problem too, but it''s very difficult to tone down a bright sky without the subject going too dark, although the fill-in flash has worked very well here.  Some sharpening will help give the subject some extra impact.  Well done with the composition though.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the feeling of being on the water with the fisherman.  Slight overexposure overall.  Needs some editing to give the image more contrast.  The sky is a problem too, but it''s very difficult to tone down a bright sky without the subject going too dark, although the fill-in flash has worked very well here.  Some sharpening will help give the subject some extra impact.  Well done with the composition though.', '2006-06-18 21:15:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526833, 345562, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice simple image, although it lacks a point of focus.  It might have been nicer to see the top of the glass, or the bottom, or something extra.  For a nice indulgent frosted glass, clean the glass REALLY well, and get a water spray bottle.  In the photo, everything looks just a little bit dirty.</td>', 'Nice simple image, although it lacks a point of focus.  It might have been nicer to see the top of the glass, or the bottom, or something extra.  For a nice indulgent frosted glass, clean the glass REALLY well, and get a water spray bottle.  In the photo, everything looks just a little bit dirty.', '2006-06-18 21:17:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526836, 347545, 39430, '<td valign="top">Looking through the thumbnails, this is the image that really caught my eye.  The saturation of colours is really overdone, but for this image it really works, and it matches so well the bright colour, plastic toy-like marketing image of fast food.  Great crop.  Well done.</td>', 'Looking through the thumbnails, this is the image that really caught my eye.  The saturation of colours is really overdone, but for this image it really works, and it matches so well the bright colour, plastic toy-like marketing image of fast food.  Great crop.  Well done.', '2006-06-18 21:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526844, 347510, 39430, '<td valign="top">Hey, I''ve seen kids eat food, and this chocolate has been artistically dabbed around his mouth.  :)  Only a parent would spot this though.  I hope you let him eat some of the chocolate afterwards.  Nice image.</td>', 'Hey, I''ve seen kids eat food, and this chocolate has been artistically dabbed around his mouth.  :)  Only a parent would spot this though.  I hope you let him eat some of the chocolate afterwards.  Nice image.', '2006-06-18 21:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526847, 345943, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.  I''m not sure whether that particular background adds to the image though.  A cleaner background would look nicer.  It looks like a close crop of a larger image.  Some sharpening is evident, maybe from the camera, yet it still doesn''t bring out the details.  I''d like to see more effective but less evident sharpening.</td>', 'Nice action shot.  I''m not sure whether that particular background adds to the image though.  A cleaner background would look nicer.  It looks like a close crop of a larger image.  Some sharpening is evident, maybe from the camera, yet it still doesn''t bring out the details.  I''d like to see more effective but less evident sharpening.', '2006-06-18 21:26:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526850, 346839, 39430, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the exposure is a bit dark, and I''d like to see some fluffy slippers next time.  :)  The image is also a little cluttered, although I''m at a loss for specific suggestions on this.</td>', 'Good idea, but the exposure is a bit dark, and I''d like to see some fluffy slippers next time.  :)  The image is also a little cluttered, although I''m at a loss for specific suggestions on this.', '2006-06-18 21:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526854, 346535, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  Some extra colour saturation would really help the impact of this image, and some USM to bring out the texture of the hair.  Great shot though!</td>', 'Nice macro.  Some extra colour saturation would really help the impact of this image, and some USM to bring out the texture of the hair.  Great shot though!', '2006-06-18 21:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526857, 345828, 39430, '<td valign="top">Umm, what is it?</td>', 'Umm, what is it?', '2006-06-18 21:31:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526869, 345944, 39430, '<td valign="top">Her expression misses the point for me - this is the look my wife gives me when I haven''t taken out the rubbish for the second week in a row, so it just slightly misses ''luxurious''.  I don''t like the effect you''ve gone for in the processing.  With the softness and the blowouts, you''ve lost the focus of the image, and it''s hard to look at without thinking my contact lenses are playing up.  The original shot looks well framed and well focused though.</td>', 'Her expression misses the point for me - this is the look my wife gives me when I haven''t taken out the rubbish for the second week in a row, so it just slightly misses ''luxurious''.  I don''t like the effect you''ve gone for in the processing.  With the softness and the blowouts, you''ve lost the focus of the image, and it''s hard to look at without thinking my contact lenses are playing up.  The original shot looks well framed and well focused though.', '2006-06-18 21:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526873, 347593, 39430, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what to think of this image.  My first impression is that I don''t really like it, but I can''t think of any suggestions, other than if the model had indeed passed out, her head wouldn''t be comfortably resting on her arm.  Her head would be on the floor.  But that''s a minor picky detail.  I''m not sure whether the desat works or not.  Maybe white balance problems in the original image, but it''s hard to tell.</td>', 'I''m not sure what to think of this image.  My first impression is that I don''t really like it, but I can''t think of any suggestions, other than if the model had indeed passed out, her head wouldn''t be comfortably resting on her arm.  Her head would be on the floor.  But that''s a minor picky detail.  I''m not sure whether the desat works or not.  Maybe white balance problems in the original image, but it''s hard to tell.', '2006-06-18 21:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526878, 346562, 39430, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge - humour, nudity and elegance in the same shot.  :)  Well setup shot, although the highlight on her midriff is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge - humour, nudity and elegance in the same shot.  :)  Well setup shot, although the highlight on her midriff is a bit distracting.', '2006-06-18 21:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526882, 344756, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not bad.  I like the lighting, although maybe just a little underexposed, and a little too cool.  A whiter (less blue) background might help, and some USM to bring out the texture of the butter.  Nice composition.</td>', 'Not bad.  I like the lighting, although maybe just a little underexposed, and a little too cool.  A whiter (less blue) background might help, and some USM to bring out the texture of the butter.  Nice composition.', '2006-06-18 21:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526889, 347304, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great expression in the composition. :)  A little more contrast would be nice.  I like the subtle varying pink tones through the image.  A whiter non-gloss wall would be better for the background.  But overall a nice shot.  Well done... and how did you get the cat to not eat it?</td>', 'Great expression in the composition. :)  A little more contrast would be nice.  I like the subtle varying pink tones through the image.  A whiter non-gloss wall would be better for the background.  But overall a nice shot.  Well done... and how did you get the cat to not eat it?', '2006-06-18 21:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526897, 345773, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice lineup.  Pity about the rain.  Also looks like a slight white balance problem.  Try overriding the WB to get some warmer colours.</td>', 'Nice lineup.  Pity about the rain.  Also looks like a slight white balance problem.  Try overriding the WB to get some warmer colours.', '2006-06-18 21:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526902, 347566, 39430, '<td valign="top">Not quite in focus, so it''s hard to look at.  The warm tone is a bit overpowering.  I like the off-centre stance, but maybe a vertical crop is worth trying?</td>', 'Not quite in focus, so it''s hard to look at.  The warm tone is a bit overpowering.  I like the off-centre stance, but maybe a vertical crop is worth trying?', '2006-06-18 21:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526905, 346563, 39430, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Nice composition, crisp focus on the hand, good lighting, and the white border works well.</td>', 'Great shot.  Nice composition, crisp focus on the hand, good lighting, and the white border works well.', '2006-06-18 21:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526917, 347527, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice use of BW.</td>', 'Nice use of BW.', '2006-06-18 21:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526920, 347335, 39430, '<td valign="top">Good action shot, and nice use of BW.  Nice crisp spray.</td>', 'Good action shot, and nice use of BW.  Nice crisp spray.', '2006-06-18 22:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526922, 346537, 39430, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot.  Slighly crooked, which is a little distracting, but not a major problem.</td>', 'Nice simple shot.  Slighly crooked, which is a little distracting, but not a major problem.', '2006-06-18 22:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526944, 346438, 39430, '<td valign="top">Actually, there''s no cereal in the photo at all.  A photo of a child in a bib and a briefcase in the background fills me with the dread of morning household chaos - not enough sleep, not enough time, children who are throwing cereal on my suit instead of eating it.  Aaaaaarrrrgghhh!!!  I need some indulgence...  :)  This is a powerful image, but not in the way it was intended.</td>', 'Actually, there''s no cereal in the photo at all.  A photo of a child in a bib and a briefcase in the background fills me with the dread of morning household chaos - not enough sleep, not enough time, children who are throwing cereal on my suit instead of eating it.  Aaaaaarrrrgghhh!!!  I need some indulgence...  :)  This is a powerful image, but not in the way it was intended.', '2006-06-18 22:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2526951, 347161, 39430, '<td valign="top">Slightly off centre, and a few background distractions, but still a nice shot.</td>', 'Slightly off centre, and a few background distractions, but still a nice shot.', '2006-06-18 22:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
