(2532652, 346537, 53859, '<td valign="top">I''m no vet, but im prety sure its a bad idea to feed chocolate to dogs.  Toxic i think.<br/> <br/>Love the texture of the mat the bowl is on.</td>', 'I''m no vet, but im prety sure its a bad idea to feed chocolate to dogs.  Toxic i think. Love the texture of the mat the bowl is on.', '2006-06-20 18:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
