(2532676, 347498, 53859, '<td valign="top">Good shot.<br/>But im not sure how the color of a dragonfly is an unnecessary luxury.</td>', 'Good shot.But im not sure how the color of a dragonfly is an unnecessary luxury.', '2006-06-20 19:08:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532684, 347486, 53859, '<td valign="top">Cute</td>', 'Cute', '2006-06-20 19:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532685, 346835, 53859, '<td valign="top">I love the kid to watermellon size ratio.</td>', 'I love the kid to watermellon size ratio.', '2006-06-20 19:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532691, 345408, 53859, '<td valign="top">Nice framing, i wish it was more in focus</td>', 'Nice framing, i wish it was more in focus', '2006-06-20 19:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532695, 345238, 53859, '<td valign="top">I think you may have taken too long setting up this shot :D .  Mmmmm , melty</td>', 'I think you may have taken too long setting up this shot :D .  Mmmmm , melty', '2006-06-20 19:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532816, 346189, 55330, '<td valign="top">woody must die!</td>', 'woody must die!', '2006-06-20 20:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532891, 347614, 18197, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, too much and too harsh a light. It looks like it was lit by the flash which was too close to the subject. Maybe try natural light or a separate light source off to the side and at a lower angle.</td>', 'In my opinion, too much and too harsh a light. It looks like it was lit by the flash which was too close to the subject. Maybe try natural light or a separate light source off to the side and at a lower angle.', '2006-06-20 20:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532904, 347545, 18197, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge in a Jenny Craig sort of way. Vibrant colors. Good contrast. But not a subject that appeals to me.</td>', 'Meets the challenge in a Jenny Craig sort of way. Vibrant colors. Good contrast. But not a subject that appeals to me.', '2006-06-20 20:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532917, 345444, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''m searching to find something positive, here. It <b>is</b> in focus. The lighting <b>is</b> good, way good enough to read the lables and to give definition to the puppet (?) through light and shadow. However I wish you had applied your talent to a subject that appealed to me more.</td>', 'I''m searching to find something positive, here. It is in focus. The lighting is good, way good enough to read the lables and to give definition to the puppet (?) through light and shadow. However I wish you had applied your talent to a subject that appealed to me more.', '2006-06-20 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532923, 344756, 18197, '<td valign="top">Competant photo. Well lit. Like the DOF. Composition''s okay. And maybe it says indulgent to you but IMO dnmc.</td>', 'Competant photo. Well lit. Like the DOF. Composition''s okay. And maybe it says indulgent to you but IMO dnmc.', '2006-06-20 20:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532935, 346377, 18197, '<td valign="top">I guess this said indulgent to you but not to me. I think it would have been better with less light ... seems over exposed. I am unsure of the story you''re trying to tell me with the photo. Guess this''ll seem negative but I''m not resonating with this one. Sorry.</td>', 'I guess this said indulgent to you but not to me. I think it would have been better with less light ... seems over exposed. I am unsure of the story you''re trying to tell me with the photo. Guess this''ll seem negative but I''m not resonating with this one. Sorry.', '2006-06-20 20:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532953, 345454, 18197, '<td valign="top">I have a number of issues with this photo. Firstly, it seems over exposed. With less light the rich color of the feathers would have shown better. The background doesn''t detract from the bird but it doesn''t contribute to the photo either. And finally the photo is too small. If you were to reshoot to correct these things, I think it would score in the 5-6 range. Lastly, it doesn''t really call out to me saying "Indulgent." Maybe there''s a cultural thing going on so it could be my issue.</td>', 'I have a number of issues with this photo. Firstly, it seems over exposed. With less light the rich color of the feathers would have shown better. The background doesn''t detract from the bird but it doesn''t contribute to the photo either. And finally the photo is too small. If you were to reshoot to correct these things, I think it would score in the 5-6 range. Lastly, it doesn''t really call out to me saying "Indulgent." Maybe there''s a cultural thing going on so it could be my issue.', '2006-06-20 20:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532966, 347294, 18197, '<td valign="top">Okay, so I get the concept. But it could be better executed in my opinion. Car in the background distracts from the message. Clip on the money is incongruous. Brights are too bright, and darks lose some detail and color saturation that could have been interesting. Put the girl''s face in the frame with more of the horse''s head and convince me of a loving relationship set in a pastoral setting ... and I''m almost there with you.</td>', 'Okay, so I get the concept. But it could be better executed in my opinion. Car in the background distracts from the message. Clip on the money is incongruous. Brights are too bright, and darks lose some detail and color saturation that could have been interesting. Put the girl''s face in the frame with more of the horse''s head and convince me of a loving relationship set in a pastoral setting ... and I''m almost there with you.', '2006-06-20 20:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532973, 347366, 58800, '<td valign="top">love the perspective on this, the line of the building against the sky hasgreat effect.</td>', 'love the perspective on this, the line of the building against the sky hasgreat effect.', '2006-06-20 20:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2532987, 346849, 58800, '<td valign="top">great idea having the pepto bismal in the background. im british and we dont have that over here but i knew what it was and the idea it adds to the image, good shot.</td>', 'great idea having the pepto bismal in the background. im british and we dont have that over here but i knew what it was and the idea it adds to the image, good shot.', '2006-06-20 21:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533001, 347600, 60370, '<td valign="top">Great picture and I looove Harleys but I don''t see overindulgence in this photo.</td>', 'Great picture and I looove Harleys but I don''t see overindulgence in this photo.', '2006-06-20 21:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533025, 346189, 18197, '<td valign="top">I didn''t vote this very highly and I am struggling to make a constructive comment. It feels to me like the whole image is over exposed. The wall behind shows almost no detail, the pasta in the forground is too bright to show any shadowing  which would have added interest. The range of levels is pretty narrow with no true blacks in the photo. Finally the photo doesn''t convey indulgence to me. I sure this seems pretty negative and I''m sorry about that.</td>', 'I didn''t vote this very highly and I am struggling to make a constructive comment. It feels to me like the whole image is over exposed. The wall behind shows almost no detail, the pasta in the forground is too bright to show any shadowing  which would have added interest. The range of levels is pretty narrow with no true blacks in the photo. Finally the photo doesn''t convey indulgence to me. I sure this seems pretty negative and I''m sorry about that.', '2006-06-20 21:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533043, 346868, 18197, '<td valign="top">My wife is a knitter and I understand very well the notion of indulging in yarn. Those who do not have a kniting connection may not feel the indulgence of this. In the case of your photo, it feels very bright to me. Did you use a flash? If so, I think it overpowered the photo and especially washed out some of the rich detail in the cat''s face which would have added a lot of interest to the photo. I usually have better luck with natural light or an external flash which gives you more control. Good luck.</td>', 'My wife is a knitter and I understand very well the notion of indulging in yarn. Those who do not have a kniting connection may not feel the indulgence of this. In the case of your photo, it feels very bright to me. Did you use a flash? If so, I think it overpowered the photo and especially washed out some of the rich detail in the cat''s face which would have added a lot of interest to the photo. I usually have better luck with natural light or an external flash which gives you more control. Good luck.', '2006-06-20 21:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533052, 347589, 18197, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Nice setting. Well costumed. Focus is good. Lighting is okay, possibly a little flat. For me though, it might have had a much richer feeling in color rather than the sepia.</td>', 'Good concept. Nice setting. Well costumed. Focus is good. Lighting is okay, possibly a little flat. For me though, it might have had a much richer feeling in color rather than the sepia.', '2006-06-20 21:18:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533059, 347542, 18197, '<td valign="top">I''d give the technical execution here about a 6 or 7. But the subject matter and relevance to the theme bring it down quite a bit.</td>', 'I''d give the technical execution here about a 6 or 7. But the subject matter and relevance to the theme bring it down quite a bit.', '2006-06-20 21:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533150, 345944, 33672, '<td valign="top">And probably your most expensive...Nice soft focus but the reflection at the top of her head detracts a bit.</td>', 'And probably your most expensive...Nice soft focus but the reflection at the top of her head detracts a bit.', '2006-06-20 21:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533155, 347598, 18197, '<td valign="top">Not getting "indulgence" out of this. Good photo, well executed.</td>', 'Not getting "indulgence" out of this. Good photo, well executed.', '2006-06-20 21:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533162, 347432, 18197, '<td valign="top">Being male, I am completely sure I can''t fully appreciate the indulgence of make-up.</td>', 'Being male, I am completely sure I can''t fully appreciate the indulgence of make-up.', '2006-06-20 21:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533168, 347493, 33672, '<td valign="top">Cute Kid! Nice capture and comp. I like how you got both hands in.  Photo could use a bit more brightness contrast/sharpening, or levels adj to really bring it out.</td>', 'Cute Kid! Nice capture and comp. I like how you got both hands in.  Photo could use a bit more brightness contrast/sharpening, or levels adj to really bring it out.', '2006-06-20 21:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533169, 347049, 18197, '<td valign="top">Due to the contrast between black background and bright subjects, this is a really difficult shot to pull off, especially with basic editing. You did a nice job with the strawberry. Two things would have improved it for me: 1) Deeper DOF; and 2) Reducing the exposure so there was some texture, more light and shadow, in the ice cream.</td>', 'Due to the contrast between black background and bright subjects, this is a really difficult shot to pull off, especially with basic editing. You did a nice job with the strawberry. Two things would have improved it for me: 1) Deeper DOF; and 2) Reducing the exposure so there was some texture, more light and shadow, in the ice cream.', '2006-06-20 21:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533172, 347162, 33672, '<td valign="top">Personally...The rifle would probably become the most useful tools in there. Nice perspective and sense of humor.</td>', 'Personally...The rifle would probably become the most useful tools in there. Nice perspective and sense of humor.', '2006-06-20 21:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533174, 345444, 33672, '<td valign="top">Now I''m scared....</td>', 'Now I''m scared....', '2006-06-20 21:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533175, 347527, 18197, '<td valign="top">Hmmm ... long nails, feminine ring ... self indulgence? Sorry but relevence to the theme isn''t ringing my chimes.</td>', 'Hmmm ... long nails, feminine ring ... self indulgence? Sorry but relevence to the theme isn''t ringing my chimes.', '2006-06-20 21:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533183, 347503, 18197, '<td valign="top">Over exposed by a hot flash. Weak composition. And IMO, a poor choice of subject which doesn''t convey indulgence to me.</td>', 'Over exposed by a hot flash. Weak composition. And IMO, a poor choice of subject which doesn''t convey indulgence to me.', '2006-06-20 22:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533206, 347545, 53147, '<td valign="top">This should be the winner. Great funny shot. Bumping up!</td>', 'This should be the winner. Great funny shot. Bumping up!', '2006-06-20 22:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
