(2533324, 347366, 37893, '<td valign="top">hehehhe only one guy would shoot this one in the same clarity and crispness ;)</td>', 'hehehhe only one guy would shoot this one in the same clarity and crispness ;)', '2006-06-20 22:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533329, 346562, 37893, '<td valign="top">The two verticals to the upper right distracts slightly but it''s a great image nonetheless.</td>', 'The two verticals to the upper right distracts slightly but it''s a great image nonetheless.', '2006-06-20 22:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533332, 347545, 37893, '<td valign="top">Great colors, crispness and clarity! Love it ;)</td>', 'Great colors, crispness and clarity! Love it ;)', '2006-06-20 22:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533343, 347281, 37893, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Great for stock photos. If I''m not mistaken this looks a lot like Cindi ;)</td>', 'Nice image. Great for stock photos. If I''m not mistaken this looks a lot like Cindi ;)', '2006-06-20 22:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533350, 347162, 37893, '<td valign="top">Silly question. But why do you have a gun in the toilet? LOL!</td>', 'Silly question. But why do you have a gun in the toilet? LOL!', '2006-06-20 22:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533367, 347543, 18799, '<td valign="top">Technically good, perhaps a little less shadow on the face. There is an odd highlight on the left side of her face that looks out of place. Composition is good, but I think a little busy. You didn''t have to include all those objects to convince me.  7</td>', 'Technically good, perhaps a little less shadow on the face. There is an odd highlight on the left side of her face that looks out of place. Composition is good, but I think a little busy. You didn''t have to include all those objects to convince me.  7', '2006-06-20 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533402, 347380, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good subject to illustrate the challenge.  I''m thinking with all those yachts, there must have been a more interesting angle to shoot from that didn''t have all those distractions like ropes and posts and other boats.  I think you could have done better.  Because of it''s strong relation to the challenge, 6</td>', 'Good subject to illustrate the challenge.  I''m thinking with all those yachts, there must have been a more interesting angle to shoot from that didn''t have all those distractions like ropes and posts and other boats.  I think you could have done better.  Because of it''s strong relation to the challenge, 6', '2006-06-20 23:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533418, 347493, 18799, '<td valign="top">Works for me!  The skin has a greenish cast that is a little displeasing to me.  I moved the window around on my monitor and found the image to be a little more compelling if it was cropped just below the elbow of the arm holding the waffle, and just a little to the left of the head.  It would give a better diagonal line between the head and the waffle to direct the eyes, and would eliminate the tabletop which doesn''t add anything to the image.  Just and opinion of course.    6</td>', 'Works for me!  The skin has a greenish cast that is a little displeasing to me.  I moved the window around on my monitor and found the image to be a little more compelling if it was cropped just below the elbow of the arm holding the waffle, and just a little to the left of the head.  It would give a better diagonal line between the head and the waffle to direct the eyes, and would eliminate the tabletop which doesn''t add anything to the image.  Just and opinion of course.    6', '2006-06-20 23:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533421, 346443, 18799, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice picture but I think it''s a little shoehorned into the challenge to me.  6</td>', 'It''s a very nice picture but I think it''s a little shoehorned into the challenge to me.  6', '2006-06-20 23:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533433, 345143, 18799, '<td valign="top">Hey man, that''s not indulgence, it''s necessity!  Just kidding.   I think it fits the challenge well.  I think it would have been better with a different color background, the colors, particularly of the control unit kind of blend in. A contrasting colorful background would have made it pop.  6</td>', 'Hey man, that''s not indulgence, it''s necessity!  Just kidding.   I think it fits the challenge well.  I think it would have been better with a different color background, the colors, particularly of the control unit kind of blend in. A contrasting colorful background would have made it pop.  6', '2006-06-20 23:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533438, 347281, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and contrasting colors with th blue and the red.  9</td>', 'Nice DOF and contrasting colors with th blue and the red.  9', '2006-06-20 23:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533455, 347173, 18799, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of messy face kids, but that does''nt affect my vote.  What I think would be better would be more thought put into the background before you took the shot. The cluttered appearance of the chairs is distracting.  Maybe a closer crop?  The sharpness is lacking a little too. 5</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of messy face kids, but that does''nt affect my vote.  What I think would be better would be more thought put into the background before you took the shot. The cluttered appearance of the chairs is distracting.  Maybe a closer crop?  The sharpness is lacking a little too. 5', '2006-06-20 23:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533464, 347486, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like the shot.  I''m thinking it could have been more powerful with a closer crop. Just an opinion.  8</td>', 'I like the shot.  I''m thinking it could have been more powerful with a closer crop. Just an opinion.  8', '2006-06-20 23:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533472, 345444, 18799, '<td valign="top">All you need is sex and you have it all covered ;)  Nice concept, good focus, good lighting  8</td>', 'All you need is sex and you have it all covered ;)  Nice concept, good focus, good lighting  8', '2006-06-20 23:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533480, 346961, 18799, '<td valign="top">Nice b/w - maybe just a little dark.  I think more of an angle would have made the image more powerful.  7</td>', 'Nice b/w - maybe just a little dark.  I think more of an angle would have made the image more powerful.  7', '2006-06-20 23:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533489, 347454, 18799, '<td valign="top">Funny concept.  Technically, there are a few issues here.   The focus isn''t great and there are quite a few blown highlights which are distracting.  I love the girl''s expression though.  6</td>', 'Funny concept.  Technically, there are a few issues here.   The focus isn''t great and there are quite a few blown highlights which are distracting.  I love the girl''s expression though.  6', '2006-06-20 23:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533500, 347330, 18799, '<td valign="top">I get the indulgence, but the image just doesn''t have much "wow" factor.  I don''t have any suggestions to help either.  5</td>', 'I get the indulgence, but the image just doesn''t have much "wow" factor.  I don''t have any suggestions to help either.  5', '2006-06-20 23:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533508, 346377, 18799, '<td valign="top">I get that this is indulgence to someone this age, but there is a real "quick snapshot" look to this image.  There is also some heavy noise or pixelation here that results in blotches on the child''s face.   5</td>', 'I get that this is indulgence to someone this age, but there is a real "quick snapshot" look to this image.  There is also some heavy noise or pixelation here that results in blotches on the child''s face.   5', '2006-06-20 23:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533517, 346382, 18799, '<td valign="top">I think this fits the challenge well.  I like the blue background because of the way it matches up with the bottle labels.  I don''t care for the diagonal crease in the cloth or the tilt effect of the bottle (I realize you can''t do anything about it in a basic challenge).  6</td>', 'I think this fits the challenge well.  I like the blue background because of the way it matches up with the bottle labels.  I don''t care for the diagonal crease in the cloth or the tilt effect of the bottle (I realize you can''t do anything about it in a basic challenge).  6', '2006-06-20 23:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533521, 346849, 18799, '<td valign="top">I like your choice of putting the pepto bismol in the background.  I think this would have been much better cropped just above the bottle.  I don''t think all that negative space on top is adding anything to the image.   7</td>', 'I like your choice of putting the pepto bismol in the background.  I think this would have been much better cropped just above the bottle.  I don''t think all that negative space on top is adding anything to the image.   7', '2006-06-20 23:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2533525, 344517, 18799, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract.  I''m not sure that I like it for this challenge, but I like it otherwise.  I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt that it is indulgence  7</td>', 'Interesting abstract.  I''m not sure that I like it for this challenge, but I like it otherwise.  I''ll give it the benefit of the doubt that it is indulgence  7', '2006-06-20 23:42:45.000000', NULL, 1),
