(2535432, 347380, 24413, '<td valign="top">Not that anyone is going to read this but I took this photo at a huge festival.  There were tons of people around so it was very hard to get a shot without people in it.  I had a split second with this one before people walked into the shot.  I''m guessing I sholdn''t have even bothered and wondering if I should ever bother entering any of these challenges again.</td>', 'Not that anyone is going to read this but I took this photo at a huge festival.  There were tons of people around so it was very hard to get a shot without people in it.  I had a split second with this one before people walked into the shot.  I''m guessing I sholdn''t have even bothered and wondering if I should ever bother entering any of these challenges again.', '2006-06-21 08:44:03.000000', NULL, 0),
