(2535458, 347486, 27482, '<td valign="top">Eh, whatever, you don´t need fancy equipment to make good photos, think you should know that by now!  This image definately proves that you don´t need a fancy smancy macro lens to take a cool macro photo, this is nice work!  Congrats on your ribbon :)</td>', 'Eh, whatever, you don´t need fancy equipment to make good photos, think you should know that by now!  This image definately proves that you don´t need a fancy smancy macro lens to take a cool macro photo, this is nice work!  Congrats on your ribbon :)', '2006-06-21 08:53:40.000000', NULL, 0),
