(2536810, 346262, 30959, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. I had a great deal of fun with this shot, as well as enjoyed devouring the prop! I think for this site, I should have chosen a different backdrop color, however my monitor shows the chocolate very clearly. To appreciate it however, requires well calibrated monitors as several "too dark" comments show. I don''t think I will tailor my shots that much for the competition as my goal is to print what shows, not hedge shots for all monitors. I am happy with the response to this. The bottom right corner of the background should be a little lighter than the upper left, showing a faint diagonal crossing from lower left to upper right.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-21 13:13:37.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. I had a great deal of fun with this shot, as well as enjoyed devouring the prop! I think for this site, I should have chosen a different backdrop color, however my monitor shows the chocolate very clearly. To appreciate it however, requires well calibrated monitors as several "too dark" comments show. I don''t think I will tailor my shots that much for the competition as my goal is to print what shows, not hedge shots for all monitors. I am happy with the response to this. The bottom right corner of the background should be a little lighter than the upper left, showing a faint diagonal crossing from lower left to upper right.', '2006-06-21 14:04:34.000000', '2006-06-21 14:13:37.000000', 0),
(2536852, 347486, 811, '<td valign="top">Yea, I''m stoked.  oh yea. oh yea.<br/> <br/>The funniest part -- I wondered if it really met the challenge.  hehehe.  I mean, I could see it, but so many times what is obvious to me is completely lost on 99% of the rest of the voters.<br/> <br/>:)</td>', 'Yea, I''m stoked.  oh yea. oh yea. The funniest part -- I wondered if it really met the challenge.  hehehe.  I mean, I could see it, but so many times what is obvious to me is completely lost on 99% of the rest of the voters. :)', '2006-06-21 14:22:42.000000', NULL, 0),
