(2537615, 346098, 3595, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TheMegalomaniac:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice idea but needs better execution. All the fine detail of the gold is lost - I''m guessing you had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements.Perhaps focussing on the centerpiece or a pillar... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>TheMegalomaniac you are wright I had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements. The quality was resented :)<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by TheMegalomaniac: Nice idea but needs better execution. All the fine detail of the gold is lost - I''m guessing you had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements.Perhaps focussing on the centerpiece or a pillar...   TheMegalomaniac you are wright I had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements. The quality was resented :)', '2006-06-21 18:38:18.000000', NULL, 0),
