(2538939, 347589, 28710, '<td valign="top">This is really nice. The expressions on their faces are heartwarming and lovely... <br/> <br/>I was going to comment something similar to what karmabreeze said.. There''s always something great about selective DOF...<br/> <br/>Colors can be tricky... I might have chosen a low saturation over the duotone... Can''t say that it would have made things better of course... Just something else I would have tried... I do like the duotone...</td>', 'This is really nice. The expressions on their faces are heartwarming and lovely...  I was going to comment something similar to what karmabreeze said.. There''s always something great about selective DOF... Colors can be tricky... I might have chosen a low saturation over the duotone... Can''t say that it would have made things better of course... Just something else I would have tried... I do like the duotone...', '2006-06-21 23:29:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(2538959, 346563, 28710, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites in reviewing the challenge. I didn''t have time to vote, so I''m just going through the pictures as is...<br/> <br/>Very clear and very well done... I almost gave it a fave.</td>', 'One of my favorites in reviewing the challenge. I didn''t have time to vote, so I''m just going through the pictures as is... Very clear and very well done... I almost gave it a fave.', '2006-06-21 23:32:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2538975, 345826, 28710, '<td valign="top">Great idea... I was thinking of something similar myself as here in Taiwan, they sell fake money that is one sided for the buddhists to burn... Us teachers use it to play games and such... Lots of fun can be had... I just didn''t think anyone would recognize the New Taiwan $1000 bill...<br/> <br/>I would have thought you might have gone with a photocopy though...<br/> <br/>Fun shot.</td>', 'Great idea... I was thinking of something similar myself as here in Taiwan, they sell fake money that is one sided for the buddhists to burn... Us teachers use it to play games and such... Lots of fun can be had... I just didn''t think anyone would recognize the New Taiwan $1000 bill... I would have thought you might have gone with a photocopy though... Fun shot.', '2006-06-21 23:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(2539007, 347527, 28710, '<td valign="top">Zow... The ultimate indulgence indeed...<br/> <br/>I think you just extended my life by ohhhh 1 minute according to Crayon''s little experiment... :)</td>', 'Zow... The ultimate indulgence indeed... I think you just extended my life by ohhhh 1 minute according to Crayon''s little experiment... :)', '2006-06-21 23:40:39.000000', NULL, 0),
