(2539112, 346562, 39429, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by eschelar:</b></div><hr/><i> Bravo. Very nicely done.. You mention that you didn''t previously have a willing model, but here is the picture... Credit? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I did say "semi-willing" model.  She was only willing if her name and face never showed.  We do live in very conservative Utah.  LOL.<br/> <br/>Thanks everyone for the comments and votes.  It''s been an interesting experience.  I''m honored to receive the 4th place.  Thanks again.</td>', 'Originally posted by eschelar: Bravo. Very nicely done.. You mention that you didn''t previously have a willing model, but here is the picture... Credit?   I did say "semi-willing" model.  She was only willing if her name and face never showed.  We do live in very conservative Utah.  LOL. Thanks everyone for the comments and votes.  It''s been an interesting experience.  I''m honored to receive the 4th place.  Thanks again.', '2006-06-21 23:55:23.000000', NULL, 0),
