(2540007, 345114, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Ahhh... superb title for the concept. Relaxing shot (not for the photog...LOL). I can barely imagine the way your bath was after some tries of self portrait like this.<br/><b>Composition</b>: like it, the crop, your head, the bubbles,...<br/><b>Subject</b>: very accurate for the challenge<br/><b>Technical</b>: a bit dark overall, colors need to bump a little bit more IMO. And focus is not very sharp in the bubbles.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: maybe a smaller aperture would have helped to improve the sharpness.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Nice idea and work.<br/> <br/>Álex</td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Ahhh... superb title for the concept. Relaxing shot (not for the photog...LOL). I can barely imagine the way your bath was after some tries of self portrait like this.Composition: like it, the crop, your head, the bubbles,...Subject: very accurate for the challengeTechnical: a bit dark overall, colors need to bump a little bit more IMO. And focus is not very sharp in the bubbles.Improvement: maybe a smaller aperture would have helped to improve the sharpness.Summary: Nice idea and work. Álex', '2006-06-22 06:34:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540014, 347589, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: wonderful enviromental portrait...LOL. Very well done.<br/><b>Composition</b>: good, using thirds<br/><b>Subject</b>: meets the challenge very well. The expressions are great.<br/><b>Technical</b>: I like the tonality here. Not sure about if the color version is better or not, I like the duotone. The focus is very depth. The lighting is superb.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: About the focus, I couldn''t help reading karmabreeze comment, and I agree about the DOF; maybe the selective focus would have bumped this photo over 6.5+<br/><b>Summary</b>: Very good job.<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: wonderful enviromental portrait...LOL. Very well done.Composition: good, using thirdsSubject: meets the challenge very well. The expressions are great.Technical: I like the tonality here. Not sure about if the color version is better or not, I like the duotone. The focus is very depth. The lighting is superb.Improvement: About the focus, I couldn''t help reading karmabreeze comment, and I agree about the DOF; maybe the selective focus would have bumped this photo over 6.5+Summary: Very good job. Álex', '2006-06-22 06:42:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540022, 347522, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: agree completely with your notes about luxury. Nice and clever shot.<br/><b>Composition</b>: as you say the foot alone would have been weird, and the book helps. My only but is that the book is too perfectly aligned to the foot, and seems a bit "posed" to me.<br/><b>Subject</b>: very good for the challenge<br/><b>Technical</b>: focus OK, lighting OK, colors OK, but I would have liked a bluer pool.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: make the water a little more dark blue with selective colors and saturation.<br/><b>Summary</b>: good shot and keep indulging...<br/> <br/>Álex</td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: agree completely with your notes about luxury. Nice and clever shot.Composition: as you say the foot alone would have been weird, and the book helps. My only but is that the book is too perfectly aligned to the foot, and seems a bit "posed" to me.Subject: very good for the challengeTechnical: focus OK, lighting OK, colors OK, but I would have liked a bluer pool.Improvement: make the water a little more dark blue with selective colors and saturation.Summary: good shot and keep indulging... Álex', '2006-06-22 06:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540294, 346125, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  Wow, I''d go to jail for that in Jersey. Nice stash! I think you needed just a little more lighting on your face, it seems to be lit from one side. Maybe just a little more sharpness on the lettering of the fireworks. Other than that I don''t see anything wrong with it. Nice picture!</td>', 'Trading post...  Wow, I''d go to jail for that in Jersey. Nice stash! I think you needed just a little more lighting on your face, it seems to be lit from one side. Maybe just a little more sharpness on the lettering of the fireworks. Other than that I don''t see anything wrong with it. Nice picture!', '2006-06-22 09:20:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540307, 346172, 11854, '<td valign="top">Trading post...<br/>  The spelling nazis probably bumped you down for your title. Nice color. Busy background. Maybe it would have helped to crop a bit tighter. I know it must be hard with the glaring lights in a showroom, but the shadows across the hood and down the drivers side door are distracting. Still a nice picture that can be fixed (not for the challenge but for yourself) with some editing.</td>', 'Trading post...  The spelling nazis probably bumped you down for your title. Nice color. Busy background. Maybe it would have helped to crop a bit tighter. I know it must be hard with the glaring lights in a showroom, but the shadows across the hood and down the drivers side door are distracting. Still a nice picture that can be fixed (not for the challenge but for yourself) with some editing.', '2006-06-22 09:26:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540521, 347330, 56797, '<td valign="top">I a litle more DOF would have helped but I like everyting else about this photo. nice job.</td>', 'I a litle more DOF would have helped but I like everyting else about this photo. nice job.', '2006-06-22 10:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2540558, 347330, 27605, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to understand the story this picture tells... it seems to suggest to me a tragedy of some sort... heart attack? and the cup was spilled onto the floor? It seems to be a stretch for entry into the INDULGENCE challenge.<br/> <br/>Technically, the photo seems a bit soft (that is, not sharply focused) and the color and contrast seem bland, sort of monotoned.  I think your score of just over 5 is a good score for this photo.</td>', 'I''m trying to understand the story this picture tells... it seems to suggest to me a tragedy of some sort... heart attack? and the cup was spilled onto the floor? It seems to be a stretch for entry into the INDULGENCE challenge. Technically, the photo seems a bit soft (that is, not sharply focused) and the color and contrast seem bland, sort of monotoned.  I think your score of just over 5 is a good score for this photo.', '2006-06-22 10:35:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2541073, 347545, 24073, '<td valign="top"><i>I''m a little confused to see this got so many 10''s. </i> <br/> <br/>Im a little confused to see this got so many 4''s.  Who and the world could give this a 4 or less.  The contrasting colors, the focus, and meeting the definition of the challenge carries it well over a 4.  Not to mention the uniqueness, DOF, and the composition.  If I scored only 1 point for each of things I mentioned its at least a 6.<br/> <br/>I personally think people can vote which ever way they choose, but it sort of begs the question who could possibly vote this a 1, 2, or 3.<br/> <br/>Congrats, very nice interpretation of the challenge, and masterfully executed.</td>', 'I''m a little confused to see this got so many 10''s.   Im a little confused to see this got so many 4''s.  Who and the world could give this a 4 or less.  The contrasting colors, the focus, and meeting the definition of the challenge carries it well over a 4.  Not to mention the uniqueness, DOF, and the composition.  If I scored only 1 point for each of things I mentioned its at least a 6. I personally think people can vote which ever way they choose, but it sort of begs the question who could possibly vote this a 1, 2, or 3. Congrats, very nice interpretation of the challenge, and masterfully executed.', '2006-06-22 13:41:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(2541090, 346125, 2490, '<td valign="top">==Trading Post==<br/> <br/>The centered composition makes this one feel much more static than I think is best for such an "explosive" picture :)  <br/> <br/>Nice smile, but I''m not sure how your "face could have been better" :)</td>', '==Trading Post== The centered composition makes this one feel much more static than I think is best for such an "explosive" picture :)   Nice smile, but I''m not sure how your "face could have been better" :)', '2006-06-22 13:47:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(2541097, 346172, 2490, '<td valign="top">==Trading Post==<br/> <br/>It is definitely an indulgence, but the little reflections of light bother me here.  I know they were out of your control, so don''t take that as harsh criticism.  I wonder if a polarizer would help with that?  Keep up the good work!</td>', '==Trading Post== It is definitely an indulgence, but the little reflections of light bother me here.  I know they were out of your control, so don''t take that as harsh criticism.  I wonder if a polarizer would help with that?  Keep up the good work!', '2006-06-22 13:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2541218, 347521, 32595, '<td valign="top">Extravagance to me and "Websters dictionary" is a form of Indulgence (self indulgence)<br/>Not saying the shot deserved a better score because there were some exceptional captures but I am tired of people "thinking" (and I use that term lightly)and scoring down pics because they dont understand the meaning of words.<br/></td>', 'Extravagance to me and "Websters dictionary" is a form of Indulgence (self indulgence)Not saying the shot deserved a better score because there were some exceptional captures but I am tired of people "thinking" (and I use that term lightly)and scoring down pics because they dont understand the meaning of words.', '2006-06-22 14:27:10.000000', NULL, 0),
