(2545434, 346807, 48739, '<td valign="top">I happen to like this alot...for 1 i can relate to this but i have had alot of game systems i like World of Warcraft ALOT....it like a drug lol. ok yto your picture i like this alot the one befor you edit looked flat and like a poster.  i likethis one because after you were done editing it looks like you have the actuall figures in there i would have gave you an 8. only due to the flash mark up in the top right and the girl in the middle her white is a little bright. but i say well done</td>', 'I happen to like this alot...for 1 i can relate to this but i have had alot of game systems i like World of Warcraft ALOT....it like a drug lol. ok yto your picture i like this alot the one befor you edit looked flat and like a poster.  i likethis one because after you were done editing it looks like you have the actuall figures in there i would have gave you an 8. only due to the flash mark up in the top right and the girl in the middle her white is a little bright. but i say well done', '2006-06-23 14:52:26.000000', NULL, 0),
