(2546767, 347454, 16912, '<td valign="top">Coming from my <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=336521&amp;page=1" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">1-4-0</a>  thread ...<br/> <br/>Hi again, I''m inclined to turn the tables and ask you to comment on this shot! Don''t do last minute entries, I''ve seen them ribbon but you and I don''t get that lucky. Nice (though sordid) idea but the bg is messy and the focus doesn''t seem sharp in the right places. Melissa might have nice knees but there is no reason to include one in this shot.</td>', 'Coming from my 1-4-0  thread ... Hi again, I''m inclined to turn the tables and ask you to comment on this shot! Don''t do last minute entries, I''ve seen them ribbon but you and I don''t get that lucky. Nice (though sordid) idea but the bg is messy and the focus doesn''t seem sharp in the right places. Melissa might have nice knees but there is no reason to include one in this shot.', '2006-06-23 21:33:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(2546772, 347380, 57658, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ara-blu:</b></div><hr/><i> Not that anyone is going to read this but I took this photo at a huge festival.  There were tons of people around so it was very hard to get a shot without people in it.  I had a split second with this one before people walked into the shot.  I''m guessing I sholdn''t have even bothered and wondering if I should ever bother entering any of these challenges again. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Aww .. come on .. don''t take it that hard .. sometimes it takes a bit more work and doesn''t come as easily. The other images in your portfolio are outstanding.(I love the bird claws).<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by ara-blu: Not that anyone is going to read this but I took this photo at a huge festival.  There were tons of people around so it was very hard to get a shot without people in it.  I had a split second with this one before people walked into the shot.  I''m guessing I sholdn''t have even bothered and wondering if I should ever bother entering any of these challenges again.   Aww .. come on .. don''t take it that hard .. sometimes it takes a bit more work and doesn''t come as easily. The other images in your portfolio are outstanding.(I love the bird claws).', '2006-06-23 21:36:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2546818, 346098, 57658, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by victor01:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by TheMegalomaniac:</b></div><hr/><i> Nice idea but needs better execution. All the fine detail of the gold is lost - I''m guessing you had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements.Perhaps focussing on the centerpiece or a pillar... </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>TheMegalomaniac you are wright I had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements. The quality was resented :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Congratulations on your top 20!! Those size restrictions always drive me crazy .. I like blending shades of a color and when I resize I get banding :)</td>', 'Originally posted by victor01: Originally posted by TheMegalomaniac: Nice idea but needs better execution. All the fine detail of the gold is lost - I''m guessing you had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements.Perhaps focussing on the centerpiece or a pillar...   TheMegalomaniac you are wright I had trouble meeting the 150K size requirements. The quality was resented :)   Congratulations on your top 20!! Those size restrictions always drive me crazy .. I like blending shades of a color and when I resize I get banding :)', '2006-06-23 21:47:10.000000', NULL, 0),
