(2548936, 345114, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club. Sorry for not being able to comment for a while on your entries.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Good take on challenge, with okay execution. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Did not like the panaromic view. Looks too small for DPC. Also, I didn''t like too much bubles. <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Like the subject, meets the challenge.<br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>The color and lighting in the front is okay.<br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>Regular corp instead panaromic. Less bubles, may be tripod little bit higer.<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Good idea, with regualr corp and different angle would have scored more.<br/> <br/>Cheers!!</td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. Sorry for not being able to comment for a while on your entries. First Impression Good take on challenge, with okay execution. Composition: Did not like the panaromic view. Looks too small for DPC. Also, I didn''t like too much bubles. Subject: Like the subject, meets the challenge.Technical (Colour and light): The color and lighting in the front is okay.Improvement: Regular corp instead panaromic. Less bubles, may be tripod little bit higer.Summary: Good idea, with regualr corp and different angle would have scored more. Cheers!!', '2006-06-24 15:47:56.000000', NULL, 0),
