(2556050, 347589, 48717, '<td valign="top">Oh My - you naughty boy!  I was just thinking that I had not seen you around and then I find this!  LOL!  Nice pic, you guys look like you are definitely having fun and indulging in more ways than one.  I like the composition and the looks on your faces.  The one thing that keeps grabbing my eye is the bright white label on the wine bottle.  If you did that by design, than you got the effect you were lookin for, but if you did not want the eye to be drawn to that, then maybe something like a carafe would have worked better.<br/> <br/>Maya<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-27 10:26:09.</i></td>', 'Oh My - you naughty boy!  I was just thinking that I had not seen you around and then I find this!  LOL!  Nice pic, you guys look like you are definitely having fun and indulging in more ways than one.  I like the composition and the looks on your faces.  The one thing that keeps grabbing my eye is the bright white label on the wine bottle.  If you did that by design, than you got the effect you were lookin for, but if you did not want the eye to be drawn to that, then maybe something like a carafe would have worked better. Maya', '2006-06-26 20:57:25.000000', '2006-06-27 11:26:09.000000', 0),
