(2556306, 347454, 15242, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club AlphaTrooper.<br/> <br/>While your image is very entertaining and the look on Melissa''s face is priceless the image didnt quite hold its own in this challenge.  Id attribute that to being a stretch to hit the challenge on the head and soft focus.  Its a great candid image though!<br/> <br/>Good Luck on future challenges!<br/></td>', 'Greetings from the critique club AlphaTrooper. While your image is very entertaining and the look on Melissa''s face is priceless the image didnt quite hold its own in this challenge.  Id attribute that to being a stretch to hit the challenge on the head and soft focus.  Its a great candid image though! Good Luck on future challenges!', '2006-06-26 22:39:38.000000', NULL, 0),
