(3638548, 347545, 66709, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Keith Maniac:</b></div><hr/><i> I can''t believe this won a ribbon.  It''s well composed (nice tight crop), well exposed, sharp, and definitely meets the challenge, but it''s just kind of ugly, IMO.  Not ribbon material, in my book. Sorry... just my opinion. Obviously the voters/commenters disagree with me. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Totaly agree with you Keith.  Howard Johnson did make the best 3 D burger.  This burger can''t whole a candle to a 3 D!</td>', 'Originally posted by Keith Maniac: I can''t believe this won a ribbon.  It''s well composed (nice tight crop), well exposed, sharp, and definitely meets the challenge, but it''s just kind of ugly, IMO.  Not ribbon material, in my book. Sorry... just my opinion. Obviously the voters/commenters disagree with me.   Totaly agree with you Keith.  Howard Johnson did make the best 3 D burger.  This burger can''t whole a candle to a 3 D!', '2007-05-10 23:06:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(3651136, 347486, 74979, '<td valign="top">Hi~<br/>Just cruisin'' through the DPC site, this is Great! You did an excellent job capturing the fly, without the benefit of a Macro lens.   Love how the eyes match the stripes in the candy!  Good for you on the BR!!</td>', 'Hi~Just cruisin'' through the DPC site, this is Great! You did an excellent job capturing the fly, without the benefit of a Macro lens.   Love how the eyes match the stripes in the candy!  Good for you on the BR!!', '2007-05-15 10:59:24.000000', NULL, 0);
